		<unit label="title" identifier="6.2" level="1">Financial Institutions and Services</unit>
		<unit label="subtitle" identifier="II" level="2">Depository Institutions and Trust Organizations</unit>
		<unit label="chapter" identifier="10" level="3">Entities Conducting Trust Business</unit>
		<unit label="article" identifier="6" level="4">Trust Powers of Savings Institutions</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>6.2-1099</section_number>
	<catch_line>Trust powers of state savings banks</catch_line>
	<text>
		State savings banks, and their subsidiaries and affiliates, may exercise fiduciary powers in the same manner as associations pursuant to this article.
	</text>
	<history>1991, c. 230, § 6.1-194.138; 2010, c. 794.</history>
</law>
